  "display_title": "The Seraphic Villainess",
  "description": "Being the only wingless princess of Tilmun, Seraphine led a lonely and miserable life among winged royals. After being killed by her own father, she wakes up 500 years later as Lady Seraphine, a young noblewoman infamous for her rare condition and wild behavior. This time, she has wings, but they are draining her mana and killing her. As more secrets surface and people from her past appear, will Seraphine finally find peace? Or will she merely remain a villainess cursed with wings?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
